    "ee372664-ea5e-46f0-94d5-3e9fc308cab6": {
      "type": "multi-column",
      "blocks": {
        "template--21716148125980__ee372664-ea5e-46f0-94d5-3e9fc308cab6-item-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/019-teacher.png",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Ontario Teachers",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>All of our courses have been designed by Ontario Certified teachers. All of our classes are taught by Ontario certified teachers. All of the credits will be handed out by Ontario certified teachers.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "template--21716148125980__ee372664-ea5e-46f0-94d5-3e9fc308cab6-item-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/no-exams.png",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Attendance Won't Affect Your Grade",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Starting this school year, attendance counts toward final grades in Ontario's in-person classrooms. Not at OEO. Our courses are fully asynchronous, so you log in when it works for you, and your grade is based on the work you submit. Write your final exam online, from anywhere in the world.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "template--21716148125980__ee372664-ea5e-46f0-94d5-3e9fc308cab6-item-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/calendar.png",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Finish in as early as 4 weeks",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Do you need a credit right away? Whatever your situation is, OEO is likely the right place for you to earn a credit. You can also take up to 12 months to complete a credit.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
